        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Upcoming Open Viewing:\r\n19 Sept, 13:30 - 14:00\r\n\r\nArtis are delighted to present to the market this excellent opportunity to acquire an easily managed, period red brick, own door investment property set in the heart of Ranelagh village. This neatly packaged investment is set out in four spacious apartments (4 x 1 beds). Retaining many original features throughout, each apartment provides comfortable and well-proportioned layouts and are capable of producing a significant rental income. The three-storey red brick terraced property has been divided into 4 self-contained apartments, all of which are separately metered and serviced. The total floor area extends to circa 134 sq. m (1,442 sq. ft). There is potential to convert the property back into a superb single family home subject to the necessary consents.\r\n\r\nOutside to the front there is a small-railed accessed directly off Beechwood Avenue Lower. To the rear is a small yard with pedestrian access to a lane.\r\n\r\nBeechwood Avenue Lower is one of Ranelagh’s most sought-after roads with excellent amenities within walking distance. The area is well known for a vast array of coffee shops, restaurants and pubs. Transport is excellent with the Beechwood and Ranelagh Luas stops both within a short 5 minute walk and bus routes available from Ranelagh Road including 11, 44, 44D & SD. Leisure activities are also well catered for with Fitzwilliam Lawn Tennis Club and Mount Pleasant Lawn Tennis Club a short walk away. A wide of array of schools are also located within walking distance, Gonzaga College, Alexandra College, Sandford Park and Ranelagh Multi-Denominational school to name but a few. The business, financial and shopping districts of the city centre are all easily accessible along with the beautiful St. Stephens Green. \r\n\r\nBER DETAILS\r\n\r\nFLAT 1 \r\nBER: G\r\nBER No: 114299209\r\nEnergy Performance Rating: 530.93 kWh/m2/yr\r\n\r\nFLAT 2\r\nBER: G\r\nBER No: 103643839\r\nEnergy Performance Rating: 839.53 kWh/m2/yr\r\n\r\nFLAT 3\r\nBER: E2\r\nBER No: 114300742\r\nEnergy Performance Rating: 342.15 kWh/m2/yr\r\n\r\nFLAT 4 \r\nBER: F \r\nBER No: 114300809\r\nEnergy Performance Rating: 420.96 kWh/m2/yr"
      },
